## Shuttle console: planet liftoff
wf-shuttle-console-liftoff = Liftoff
wf-shuttle-console-cancel-liftoff = Cancel liftoff

## Liftoff gates
wf-liftoff-no-hull = This console is not aboard a flyable hull.
wf-liftoff-not-grounded = Liftoff can only engage while the hull is landed on a planet.
wf-liftoff-not-planet = This hull is not flying over a planet.
wf-liftoff-pilot-lost = Take control of this shuttle console before engaging liftoff.
wf-liftoff-force-anchored = The hull is force-anchored and cannot lift off.
wf-liftoff-power-deficit = Not enough power for the thrusters to lift the hull.
wf-liftoff-insufficient-lift = Not enough lift: { $percent }% of the 100% needed.
wf-liftoff-blocked = Something is holding the hull down.
